-- תקנון שירות עובדי הוראה, פרק 1ב, §1.29 דרגת שכר וותק
-- Salary grade and seniority: the grades, every route the takanon gives to
-- each grade, how professional seniority is counted (the work that earns
-- it, its general rules, military and national service), and the
-- equivalent grades (yeshiva graduates, college graduates teaching
-- Judaism, training-subject teachers, graduates of a training institution),
-- the definitions, the procedure and appeals, and refunds of overpayments.

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT common

§ `1.29 דרגת שכר וותק`

