            (GIVEN file YIELD `found met` file "יז(10)(ד)" AND file's `years in the certificated post at sea` AT LEAST 2),
        @ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_29__ssec_1_29_2_7/p22
        `grade route` `de facto certified professional instructor` "יז(10)(ה)" "a sea instructor certificated as chief or first electrical officer, after 2 years in that post at sea" ""
            (GIVEN file YIELD `found met` file "יז(10)(ה)" AND file's `years in the certificated post at sea` AT LEAST 2),
        @ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_29__ssec_1_29_2_7/p23
        `grade route` `de facto certified professional instructor` "יז(10)(ו)" "a sea instructor certificated as chief steward, after 2 years in that post at sea" ""
            (GIVEN file YIELD `found met` file "יז(10)(ו)" AND file's `years in the certificated post at sea` AT LEAST 2),
        @ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_29__ssec_1_29_2_7/p24
        `route` `de facto certified professional instructor` "יז(10)(ז)" "a sea instructor who is a Navy major or captain with professional training the supervision finds suitable" "",
        @ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_29__ssec_1_29_2_7/p25
        `grade route` `de facto certified professional instructor` "יז(10)(ח)" "a sea instructor who graduated a sea school of three years or more, with 5 years of professional work at sea or in sea instruction" ""
            (GIVEN file YIELD `found met` file "יז(10)(ח)" AND file's `years of professional work at sea or in sea instruction` AT LEAST 5)

-- akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_29__ssec_1_29_2_4/p2 Item י(1): "this clause is cancelled".

-- akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_29__ssec_1_29_2_2/p58 akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_29__ssec_1_29_2_2/p59 akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_29__ssec_1_29_2_2/p60 akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_29__ssec_1_29_2_2/p61 akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_29__ssec_1_29_2_2/p62 akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_29__ssec_1_29_2_2/p63 akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_29__ssec_1_29_2_2/p64 akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_29__ssec_1_29_2_2/p65 akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_29__ssec_1_29_2_2/p66 akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_29__ssec_1_29_2_2/p67 akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_29__ssec_1_29_2_2/p68 akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_29__ssec_1_29_2_2/p69 akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_29__ssec_1_29_2_2/p70 Sources (אסמכתא) of 1.29.2.2.
-- akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_29__ssec_1_29_2_3/p20 akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_29__ssec_1_29_2_3/p21 akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_29__ssec_1_29_2_3/p22 akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_29__ssec_1_29_2_3/p23 akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_29__ssec_1_29_2_3/p24 akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_29__ssec_1_29_2_3/p25 akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_29__ssec_1_29_2_3/p26 akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_29__ssec_1_29_2_3/p27 akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_29__ssec_1_29_2_3/p28 akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_29__ssec_1_29_2_3/p29 akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_29__ssec_1_29_2_3/p30 akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_29__ssec_1_29_2_3/p31 akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_29__ssec_1_29_2_3/p32 akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_29__ssec_1_29_2_3/p33 Sources (אסמכתא) of 1.29.2.3.
-- akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_29__ssec_1_29_2_4/p55 akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_29__ssec_1_29_2_4/p56 akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_29__ssec_1_29_2_4/p57 akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_29__ssec_1_29_2_4/p58 akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_29__ssec_1_29_2_4/p59 akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_29__ssec_1_29_2_4/p60 akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_29__ssec_1_29_2_4/p61 akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_29__ssec_1_29_2_4/p62 akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_29__ssec_1_29_2_4/p63 akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_29__ssec_1_29_2_4/p64 akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_29__ssec_1_29_2_4/p65 akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_29__ssec_1_29_2_4/p66 akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_29__ssec_1_29_2_4/p67 akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_29__ssec_1_29_2_4/p68 akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_29__ssec_1_29_2_4/p69 akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_29__ssec_1_29_2_4/p70 akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_29__ssec_1_29_2_4/p71 Sources (אסמכתא) of 1.29.2.4.
-- akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_29__ssec_1_29_2_5/p2 akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_29__ssec_1_29_2_5/p3 akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_29__ssec_1_29_2_5/p4 akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_29__ssec_1_29_2_5/p5 Sources (אסמכתא) of 1.29.2.5.
-- akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_29__ssec_1_29_2_7/p28 akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_29__ssec_1_29_2_7/p29 akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_29__ssec_1_29_2_7/p30 akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_29__ssec_1_29_2_7/p31 akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_29__ssec_1_29_2_7/p32 akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_29__ssec_1_29_2_7/p33 Sources (אסמכתא) of 1.29.2.7.

-- (טו) and (יח) are residual: less education than the grade above needs.
-- They apply where no route above is met.
@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_29__ssec_1_29_2_6/p19 akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_29__ssec_1_29_2_6/p20 akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_29__ssec_1_29_2_7/p26 akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_29__ssec_1_29_2_7/p27
GIVEN file IS A `grading file`
GIVETH A `salary grade`
DECIDE `the residual grade` file IS
    IF file's `a professional instructor`
    THEN `uncertified professional instructor`
    ELSE `uncertified teacher or kindergarten teacher, stage B`

§§ `1.29.2 Which grade an employee is paid by`

-- The routes of 1.29.2.2–1.29.2.7 together, and the rank the order of
-- 1.29.2.1(א) is read as giving the grades (F-1.29-a).
GIVEN g IS A `salary grade`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `rank of` g IS
    CONSIDER g
    WHEN `academic grade, doctorate`                              THEN 1
    WHEN `academic grade, MA`                                     THEN 2
    WHEN `academic grade, BA`                                     THEN 3
    WHEN `intermediate academic grade C`                          THEN 4
    WHEN `intermediate academic grade B`                          THEN 5
    WHEN `intermediate academic grade A`                          THEN 6
    WHEN `academic intermediate supplement`                       THEN 7
    WHEN `senior certified teacher`                               THEN 8
    WHEN `certified teacher`                                      THEN 9
    WHEN `certified kindergarten teacher`                         THEN 10
    WHEN `uncertified teacher or kindergarten teacher, stage AA`  THEN 11
    WHEN `uncertified teacher or kindergarten teacher, stage A+`  THEN 12
    WHEN `uncertified teacher or kindergarten teacher, stage A`   THEN 13
    WHEN `uncertified teacher or kindergarten teacher, stage B`   THEN 14
    WHEN `certified professional instructor`                      THEN 15
    WHEN `de facto certified professional instructor`             THEN 16
    WHEN `uncertified professional instructor`                    THEN 17

GIVEN n IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A `salary grade`
DECIDE `the grade of rank` n IS
    BRANCH IF n EQUALS 1  THEN `academic grade, doctorate`
           IF n EQUALS 2  THEN `academic grade, MA`
           IF n EQUALS 3  THEN `academic grade, BA`
           IF n EQUALS 4  THEN `intermediate academic grade C`
           IF n EQUALS 5  THEN `intermediate academic grade B`
           IF n EQUALS 6  THEN `intermediate academic grade A`
           IF n EQUALS 7  THEN `academic intermediate supplement`
           IF n EQUALS 8  THEN `senior certified teacher`
           IF n EQUALS 9  THEN `certified teacher`
           IF n EQUALS 10 THEN `certified kindergarten teacher`
           IF n EQUALS 11 THEN `uncertified teacher or kindergarten teacher, stage AA`
           IF n EQUALS 12 THEN `uncertified teacher or kindergarten teacher, stage A+`
           IF n EQUALS 13 THEN `uncertified teacher or kindergarten teacher, stage A`
           IF n EQUALS 14 THEN `uncertified teacher or kindergarten teacher, stage B`
           IF n EQUALS 15 THEN `certified professional instructor`
           IF n EQUALS 16 THEN `de facto certified professional instructor`
           OTHERWISE `uncertified professional instructor`

`all grade routes` MEANS
    concat (LIST `routes to the doctorate grade`,
                 `routes to the MA grade`,
                 `routes to the BA grade`,
                 `routes to the intermediate grades and supplement`,
                 `routes to the senior certified teacher grade`,
                 `routes to the certified teacher grade`,
                 `routes to the certified kindergarten teacher grade`,
                 `routes to the uncertified grades`,
                 `routes to the instructor grades`)

GIVEN file IS A `grading file`
GIVETH A LIST OF `salary grade`
DECIDE `grades the routes give` file IS
    nub (map (GIVEN r YIELD r's `route grade`) (filter (GIVEN r YIELD `the route is met` r file) `all grade routes`))

-- F-1.29-a: where several routes are met, the highest grade by the order
-- of 1.29.2.1(א) is read as governing.
GIVEN file IS A `grading file`
GIVETH A `salary grade`
DECIDE `the salary grade` file IS
    IF null (`grades the routes give` file)
    THEN `the residual grade` file
    ELSE `the grade of rank` (minimum1 99 (map (GIVEN g YIELD `rank of` g) (`grades the routes give` file)))

-- F-1.29-a: a nursing teacher who is a registered nurse without a teaching
-- licence is given the certified-teacher grade by (י)(36) and the de facto
-- certified instructor grade by (יז)(5); with a permanent licence, senior
-- certified teacher by (ט)(11) and certified instructor by (טז)(4).
`a nursing teacher, registered nurse, no licence` MEANS
    `grading file` WITH
        `clauses found met`                     IS EMPTY
        `recognised seniority in teaching`      IS 5
        `years in the certificated post at sea` IS 0
        `years commanding a ship or instructing in the Navy` IS 0
        `years of professional work at sea or in sea instruction` IS 0
        `Hebrew University points`              IS 0
        `years as a general teacher`            IS 0
        `registered nurse`                      IS TRUE
        `permanent teaching licence`            IS FALSE
        `teaches nursing`                       IS TRUE
        `Israeli matriculation or pre-academic preparatory` IS FALSE
        `a professional instructor`             IS FALSE

`a nursing teacher, registered nurse, permanent licence` MEANS
    `grading file` WITH
        `clauses found met`                     IS EMPTY
        `recognised seniority in teaching`      IS 5
        `years in the certificated post at sea` IS 0
        `years commanding a ship or instructing in the Navy` IS 0
        `years of professional work at sea or in sea instruction` IS 0
        `Hebrew University points`              IS 0
        `years as a general teacher`            IS 0
        `registered nurse`                      IS TRUE
        `permanent teaching licence`            IS TRUE
        `teaches nursing`                       IS TRUE
        `Israeli matriculation or pre-academic preparatory` IS FALSE
        `a professional instructor`             IS FALSE

`the nursing teacher is given two grades by two lists` MEANS
        `grades the routes give` `a nursing teacher, registered nurse, no licence`
            EQUALS LIST `certified teacher`, `de facto certified professional instructor`
    AND `grades the routes give` `a nursing teacher, registered nurse, permanent licence`
            EQUALS LIST `senior certified teacher`, `certified professional instructor`
#ASSERT `the nursing teacher is given two grades by two lists`

#ASSERT `the salary grade` `a nursing teacher, registered nurse, no licence` EQUALS `certified teacher`

§§ `1.29.3.1 הוראות כלליות — counting professional seniority`

-- akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_29__ssec_1_29_3_1/p1 An amendment note ("updated 5.2.03").

@desc One school year of a teaching employee's past work, as far as seniority under 1.29.3 asks about it.
DECLARE `year of work` HAS
    `months teaching`                      IS A NUMBER  @desc full months of paid teaching in the school year, after the employee turned 18
    `teaching position fraction`           IS A NUMBER  @desc the share of a position taught, hours in all institutions added together (1.29.3.1(5))
    `months in instruction or other work`  IS A NUMBER  @desc full months of paid instruction or other qualifying work, after 18
    `other work position fraction`         IS A NUMBER
    `months of paid sick leave`            IS A NUMBER  @desc the sick-day fund's grants included
    `months of maternity or accident leave paid by National Insurance` IS A NUMBER
    `months of reserve duty`               IS A NUMBER
    `suspended for legal proceedings`      IS A BOOLEAN
    `paid without working at all`          IS A BOOLEAN @desc stopped work for any reason, or received salary without working at all (1.29.3.1(9))
    `the Ofek Hadash internship year`      IS A BOOLEAN @desc the year was the internship year of an employee under the Ofek Hadash reform (1.29.3.2)

-- (1) and (2): the increment follows the salary tables in force, applies
-- from 1 September of each school year, up to 36 years. The table's amount
-- is an input.
@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_29__ssec_1_29_3_1__para_1 akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_29__ssec_1_29_3_1__para_2
GIVEN `professional seniority` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `years the seniority increment is paid for` `professional seniority` IS
    min `professional seniority` 36

-- The increment is fixed on 1 September and does not move during the year.
GIVEN `seniority on 1 September` IS A NUMBER, m IS A `school month`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `seniority for the increment in month` `seniority on 1 September` m IS
    `years the seniority increment is paid for` `seniority on 1 September`

-- (3): fewer than 6 full months in the year — the listed absences counted
-- as work — and the year does not count.
@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_29__ssec_1_29_3_1__para_3
GIVEN y IS A `year of work`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `months counted as work` y IS
        y's `months teaching`
    PLUS y's `months in instruction or other work`
    PLUS y's `months of paid sick leave`
    PLUS y's `months of maternity or accident leave paid by National Insurance`
    PLUS y's `months of reserve duty`

GIVEN y IS A `year of work`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the year is left out under (3)` y IF
    `months counted as work` y LESS THAN 6

-- 1.29.3.2's opening: paid work in one school year, 6 months at least, at
-- a third of a position in teaching, or at half in instruction or other
-- work; and each criterion stands alone, never combined in one year. The
-- absences (3) counts as work are counted with teaching.
@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_29__ssec_1_29_3_2/p1 akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_29__ssec_1_29_3_2/p2
GIVEN y IS A `year of work`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the year meets the work conditions` y IF
        (`months counted as work` y MINUS y's `months in instruction or other work` AT LEAST 6
         AND y's `teaching position fraction` AT LEAST 1/3)
    OR  (y's `months in instruction or other work` AT LEAST 6
         AND y's `other work position fraction` AT LEAST 1/2)

-- (9). F-1.29-c: (3) counts paid sick leave as work, and (9) denies
-- seniority to one who "receives salary without working at all"; a year
-- wholly on paid sick leave is both. This file reads (9) as not reaching
-- the absences (3) names.
@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_29__ssec_1_29_3_1__para_9
GIVEN y IS A `year of work`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `barred by (9)` y IF
        y's `suspended for legal proceedings`
    OR (y's `paid without working at all` AND `months counted as work` y EQUALS 0)

`a year wholly on paid sick leave` MEANS
    `year of work` WITH
        `months teaching`                     IS 0
        `teaching position fraction`          IS 1
        `months in instruction or other work` IS 0
        `other work position fraction`       IS 0
        `months of paid sick leave`           IS 10
        `months of maternity or accident leave paid by National Insurance` IS 0
        `months of reserve duty`              IS 0
        `suspended for legal proceedings`     IS FALSE
        `paid without working at all`         IS TRUE
        `the Ofek Hadash internship year`     IS FALSE

`(3) counts the sick-leave year and (9) bars it` MEANS
        `months counted as work` `a year wholly on paid sick leave` AT LEAST 6
    AND `a year wholly on paid sick leave`'s `paid without working at all`
#ASSERT `(3) counts the sick-leave year and (9) bars it`
#ASSERT `the year qualifies` `a year wholly on paid sick leave`

-- (4): regular service interrupting teaching counts if the employee
-- returned within 6 months of discharge and had taught 6 months before;
-- career service the same, if not longer than two years.
@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_29__ssec_1_29_3_1__para_4
GIVEN `months taught before enlisting` IS A NUMBER
      `months from discharge to return` IS A NUMBER
      `a career-service term in years` IS A NUMBER @desc 0 for regular (compulsory) service
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the interrupting army service counts` `months taught before enlisting` `months from discharge to return` `a career-service term in years` IF
        `months taught before enlisting` AT LEAST 6
    AND `months from discharge to return` AT MOST 6
    AND `a career-service term in years` AT MOST 2

-- (5): periods with breaks are added up; hours in several institutions in
-- one school year are combined.
@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_29__ssec_1_29_3_1__para_5
GIVEN `position fractions in each institution` IS A LIST OF NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the year's combined position` `position fractions in each institution` IS
    sum `position fractions in each institution`

GIVEN `months of each period of work in the year` IS A LIST OF NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the year's months of work, breaks notwithstanding` `months of each period of work in the year` IS
    sum `months of each period of work in the year`

-- (6): work before 18 is left out of the months the record holds.
@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_29__ssec_1_29_3_1__para_6
GIVEN `age when the work was done` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the work may count` `age when the work was done` IF
    `age when the work was done` AT LEAST 18

-- (7): a break is not counted unless this chapter expressly says otherwise.
@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_29__ssec_1_29_3_1__para_7
GIVEN `the chapter expressly counts this break` IS A BOOLEAN, `months of the break` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `months of a break counted` `the chapter expressly counts this break` `months of the break` IS
    IF `the chapter expressly counts this break` THEN `months of the break` ELSE 0

-- (8): years recognised at half, rounded up when odd (the examples: 1 → 1,
-- 3 → 2, 5 → 3). F-1.29-b: the rule is stated for one who "worked more
-- than two years", and its first example is one year.
@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_29__ssec_1_29_3_1__para_8
GIVEN `years at half seniority` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `years recognised at half` `years at half seniority` IS
    CEILING (`years at half seniority` DIVIDED BY 2)

GIVEN `years at half seniority` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `years recognised at half, the rule read as stated` `years at half seniority` IS
    IF `years at half seniority` GREATER THAN 2
    THEN CEILING (`years at half seniority` DIVIDED BY 2)
    ELSE `years at half seniority` DIVIDED BY 2

#ASSERT `years recognised at half` 3 EQUALS 2 AND `years recognised at half` 5 EQUALS 3

`the first example of (8) falls outside its own rule` MEANS
    NOT (`years recognised at half, the rule read as stated` 1 EQUALS 1)
#ASSERT `the first example of (8) falls outside its own rule`

-- akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_29__ssec_1_29_3_1/p2 akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_29__ssec_1_29_3_1/p3 akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_29__ssec_1_29_3_1/p4 akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_29__ssec_1_29_3_1/p5 Sources (אסמכתא) of 1.29.3.1.

§§ `1.29.3 Professional seniority on 1 September`

-- A year earns seniority when it meets 1.29.3.2's work conditions, is not
-- left out by 1.29.3.1(3) or barred by (9), and is not an Ofek Hadash
-- internship year (1.29.3.2, p5).
GIVEN y IS A `year of work`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the year qualifies` y IF
        `the year meets the work conditions` y
    AND (NOT `the year is left out under (3)` y)
    AND (NOT `barred by (9)` y)
    AND (NOT `the year is an Ofek Hadash internship year` y)

-- Professional seniority on 1 September of a school year: the qualifying
-- years before it, plus years credited elsewhere (military service, items
-- of 1.29.3.2). The year being served is not counted: on 1 September of the
-- first year the employee has 0, and seniority moves "after the first year
-- of work" (1.29.3.2). This is what section 1.7's F-1.7-b asked.
GIVEN `past years` IS A LIST OF `year of work`
      `years credited otherwise` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `seniority on 1 September` `past years` `years credited otherwise` IS
    min 36 (count (filter (GIVEN y YIELD `the year qualifies` y) `past years`) PLUS `years credited otherwise`)

#ASSERT `seniority on 1 September` EMPTY 0 EQUALS 0

§§ `1.29.3.2 עבודה המזכה בוותק`

DECLARE `kind of seniority` IS ONE OF
    `actual teaching seniority`
    `seniority recognised for salary only`
    `no seniority`

DECLARE `seniority document` IS ONE OF
    `none required`
    `the owning body's report`
    `original or certified employment confirmations`
    `the National Insurance report of periods of employment`
    `payslips and further documents on demand`

-- akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_29__ssec_1_29_3_2/p3 Lead-in: "for recognising seniority the following confirmations are shown".
-- akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_29__ssec_1_29_3_2/p4 Heading: "actual teaching seniority (criterion א below)".

-- p5: in official institutions no confirmations, seniority advancing by
-- itself after the first year; p6: recognised unofficial ones, by the
-- owning body's report; p7–p10: salary seniority needs the documents.
@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_29__ssec_1_29_3_2/p5 akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_29__ssec_1_29_3_2/p6 akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_29__ssec_1_29_3_2/p7 akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_29__ssec_1_29_3_2/p8 akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_29__ssec_1_29_3_2/p9 akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_29__ssec_1_29_3_2/p10
GIVEN k IS A `kind of seniority`, `in an official institution` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A LIST OF `seniority document`
DECIDE `documents to show` k `in an official institution` IS
    CONSIDER k
    WHEN `actual teaching seniority` THEN
        IF `in an official institution`
        THEN LIST `none required`
        ELSE LIST `the owning body's report`
    WHEN `seniority recognised for salary only` THEN
        LIST `original or certified employment confirmations`,
             `the National Insurance report of periods of employment`,
             `payslips and further documents on demand`
    OTHERWISE EMPTY

-- p5: under the Ofek Hadash reform the internship year is not a year of
-- seniority.
GIVEN y IS A `year of work`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the year is an Ofek Hadash internship year` y IF
    y's `the Ofek Hadash internship year`

-- א (p12, p13): actual teaching seniority only for teaching in an
-- institution under the Compulsory Education Law and the School
-- Supervision Law, licensed and run by them. א.1 (p14): teaching there
-- while not employed by the Ministry or the owning body, on the
-- principal's confirmation, is seniority for salary only.
@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_29__ssec_1_29_3_2/p12 akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_29__ssec_1_29_3_2/p13 akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_29__ssec_1_29_3_2/p14
GIVEN `a licensed institution under the two laws` IS A BOOLEAN
      `employed by the Ministry or the owning body` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the principal confirms the work` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `kind of seniority`
DECIDE `seniority for teaching in an institution` `a licensed institution under the two laws` `employed by the Ministry or the owning body` `the principal confirms the work` IS
    IF (NOT `a licensed institution under the two laws`)
    THEN `no seniority`
    ELSE IF `employed by the Ministry or the owning body`
         THEN `actual teaching seniority`
         ELSE IF `the principal confirms the work`
              THEN `seniority recognised for salary only`
              ELSE `no seniority`

§§ `1.29.3.2 The work recognised as seniority for salary`

DECLARE `item status` IS ONE OF
    `in force`
    `cancelled`
    `in force until 31.8.2023, then under item 53`
    `in force from 1.9.2023`
    `folded into another item`

@desc One item of 1.29.3.2's list of work recognised as seniority for salary.
DECLARE `seniority item` HAS
    `item number`            IS A STRING
    `work recognised`        IS A STRING
    `status`                 IS AN `item status`
    `half without the qualification` IS A BOOLEAN @desc the item recognises half the seniority for one who lacked, while working, the qualification it names (a teaching certification, or for item 19 a degree in the profession)

`the salary-seniority items` MEANS
    LIST
        @ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_29__ssec_1_29_3_2/p15
        `seniority item` "1" "teaching in a recognised institution of higher education" `in force` FALSE,
        @ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_29__ssec_1_29_3_2/p16
        `seniority item` "2" "cancelled" `cancelled` FALSE,
        @ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_29__ssec_1_29_3_2/p17 akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_29__ssec_1_29_3_2/p18
        `seniority item` "3" "teaching in Youth Aliyah or the Israel children's training scheme (\"instruction\" meaning supplementary education, not vocational instruction)" `in force until 31.8.2023, then under item 53` FALSE,
        @ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_29__ssec_1_29_3_2/p19
        `seniority item` "4" "teaching in a field school" `in force` FALSE,
        @ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_29__ssec_1_29_3_2/p20
        `seniority item` "5" "teaching in schools of other government ministries" `in force` FALSE,
        @ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_29__ssec_1_29_3_2/p21
        `seniority item` "6" "cancelled" `cancelled` FALSE,
        @ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_29__ssec_1_29_3_2/p22
        `seniority item` "7" "cancelled" `cancelled` FALSE,
        @ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_29__ssec_1_29_3_2/p23
        `seniority item` "8" "work as a substitute: 6 full months at a third of a position, 150 days at half on average, or 375 hours (elementary, adult education) or 300 hours (secondary, seminaries, colleges) counted at most 100 a month, with at least six months of work" `in force` FALSE,
        @ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_29__ssec_1_29_3_2/p24
        `seniority item` "9" "folded into criterion א" `folded into another item` FALSE,
        @ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_29__ssec_1_29_3_2/p25
        `seniority item` "9א" "cancelled" `cancelled` FALSE,
        @ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_29__ssec_1_29_3_2/p26
        `seniority item` "10" "teaching during regular or career army service or police or security-forces service, on a confirmation from one of the named commanders" `in force` FALSE,
        @ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_29__ssec_1_29_3_2/p27 akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_29__ssec_1_29_3_2/p28
        `seniority item` "11" "physical-training instruction in the IDF by a certified teacher or seminary graduate" `in force until 31.8.2023, then under item 53` FALSE,
        @ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_29__ssec_1_29_3_2/p29
        `seniority item` "12" "physical-training instruction in the IDF or police without a seminary diploma, on conditions the text announces and does not list (F-1.29-d)" `in force` FALSE,
        @ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_29__ssec_1_29_3_2/p30
        `seniority item` "13" "career officer service in a command post, or officer service in instruction or as an education officer, for a discharged teacher of 40 or more, discharged as major (or police equivalent) at least, with a certified teacher's education or one passed academic department; never more than 28 years; from 1.4.88" `in force` FALSE,
        @ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_29__ssec_1_29_3_2/p31
        `seniority item` "14" "cancelled" `cancelled` FALSE,
        @ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_29__ssec_1_29_3_2/p32
